Day 6 — AI Job Matching Pipeline Stabilization & Scoring Improvements

- Built and stabilized an AI-powered job matching system that analyzes real job postings and evaluates candidate fit using Python, SQL, and OpenAI APIs
- Integrated structured AI analysis to extract required skills, missing skills, and job requirements from live Job Bank postings
- Improved job classification logic to route roles into IT or Sales categories based on weighted keyword analysis
- Reworked scoring system to better reflect entry-level job market expectations, improving score realism from overly strict outputs (~5–30) to more accurate ranges (~35–75)
- Fixed multiple system issues including:
    * broken AI response handling
    * inconsistent job classification bias
    * database schema mismatches
    * unreliable scraping outputs
- Validated full pipeline flow from web scraping → database storage → AI analysis → scoring → recommendation generation
